From: Folia 2b2t Contributors <noreply@folia2b2t.dev>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 23:00:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Keep modern ender pearl tickets active

Preserve the modern pearl ticket behavior without a fork-specific stasis
configuration or startup loader. Existing Paper legacy behavior remains
controlled by the existing Paper setting.

diff --git a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/level/entity/server/ServerEntityLookup.java b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/level/entity/server/ServerEntityLookup.java
--- a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/level/entity/server/ServerEntityLookup.java
+++ b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/level/entity/server/ServerEntityLookup.java
@@ -35,7 +35,8 @@ public final class ServerEntityLookup extends EntityLookup {
     public ServerEntityLookup(final ServerLevel world, final LevelCallback<Entity> worldCallback) {
         super(world, worldCallback);
         this.serverWorld = world;
-        this.keepEnderPearlsTicking = PlatformHooks.get().addTicketForEnderPearls(world);
+        this.keepEnderPearlsTicking = PlatformHooks.get().addTicketForEnderPearls(world)
+            || !world.paperConfig().misc.legacyEnderPearlBehavior;
     }
 
     @Override
